== a path outside the granted prefix, one with a .., and a sibling of the granted directory: traps, not missing files
outside: killed by a signal
dotdot: killed by a signal
sibling: killed by a signal
== a written file is readable by its owner (open is variadic: a mode that travelled in the wrong place left it unreadable)
write: exit 0
content: written
owner bits: rw
== a missing file is -1, not a trap
missing: exit 1
== a short path under a narrowed prefix is read (the check's loop unrolled; LLVM once folded the read to poison)
short: exit 3
== a file op is an operand of a comparison, of && and of ||
operand: exit 7
